# ============================================
# Notes
# ============================================
#
# This .gitignore excludes Unity-generated files that should NOT be in version control.
# Binary assets that ARE tracked (via .gitattributes) will be handled by Git LFS.
#
# Files that ARE tracked:
# - Assets/ folder and .meta files
# - ProjectSettings/ folder
# - Packages/manifest.json and packages-lock.json
# - .gitattributes, .gitignore, README.md
# - Documentation in docs/ folder
#
# Files that are EXCLUDED (this .gitignore):
# - Library/ (Unity cache - regenerated)
# - Temp/ (temporary files - regenerated)
# - Logs/ (log files - regenerated)
# - Build/ (build outputs - regenerated)
# - UserSettings/ (user-specific settings)
# - Auto-generated .csproj and .sln files
#

=======
# Precompiled Assets
SourceArt/**/*.png
SourceArt/**/*.tga

# Binary Files
Binaries/*
Plugins/**/Binaries/*

# Builds
Build/*

# Whitelist PakBlacklist-<BuildConfiguration>.txt files
!Build/*/
Build/*/**
!Build/*/PakBlacklist*.txt

# Don't ignore icon files in Build
!Build/**/*.ico

# Built data for maps
*_BuiltData.uasset

# Configuration files generated by the Editor
Saved/*

# Compiled source files for the engine to use
Intermediate/*
Plugins/**/Intermediate/*

# Cache files for the editor to use
DerivedDataCache/*
